{"id":"7b939b7524b2074c","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-prob3-adapted-process.md","title":"ZFC Prob3 Adapted Process","display":"df-zfc-prob3-adapted-process — ZFC Prob3 Adapted Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob3-adapted-process","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob3-adapted-process"],"display":"df-zfc-prob3-adapted-process — ZFC Prob3 Adapted Process","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob3-adapted-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob3-adapted-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob3-adapted-process — ZFC Prob3 Adapted Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-linear-order\">58-df-zfc-linear-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathbb T,I,\\leq_I,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec{\\mathcal F},X\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathbb T,I,\\leq_I,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec{\\mathcal F},X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-linear-order\">58-df-zfc-linear-order</a>), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a>), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3AdaptedProcess}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3AdaptedProcess}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb3AdaptedProcess}_S(\\Omega,\\mathbb T,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec{\\mathcal F},X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,\\leq_I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb T=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;(s\\leq_It\\to\\vec{\\mathcal F}(s)\\subseteq\\vec{\\mathcal F}(t))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,E^\\Omega)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}(t),\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X(t),\\Omega,E)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal E\\;(X(t)^{-1}[B]\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(t))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb3AdaptedProcess}_S(\\Omega,\\mathbb T,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec{\\mathcal F},X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,\\leq_I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb T=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;(s\\leq_It\\to\\vec{\\mathcal F}(s)\\subseteq\\vec{\\mathcal F}(t))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,E^\\Omega)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}(t),\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X(t),\\Omega,E)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal E\\;(X(t)^{-1}[B]\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(t))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The filtration and process share the same explicit sample space and index order; neither is hidden inside an existential upstream witness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]), $\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]]), and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]), $\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]]), and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-linear-order]]), $\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]]), and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathbb T,I,\\leq_I,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec{\\mathcal F},X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3AdaptedProcess}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb3AdaptedProcess}_S(\\Omega,\\mathbb T,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec{\\mathcal F},X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,\\leq_I\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb T=\\langle I,\\leq_I\\rangle\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;(s\\leq_It\\to\\vec{\\mathcal F}(s)\\subseteq\\vec{\\mathcal F}(t))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,E^\\Omega)\\land\\f